SUMMARY:Sarah Colonna LIVE at Brad Garrett's Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nSarah Colonna LIVE at Brad Garrett’s Comedy Club\nComedian\, actress\, and bestselling author Sarah Colonna headlines Brad Garrett’s Comedy Club inside MGM Grand in Las Vegas on August 4\, 2026. Best known for her years as a roundtable regular on Chelsea Lately\, Sarah brings her sharp wit and candid humor to the Strip for a night you won’t forget. \nEvent Details\nDate: Tuesday\, August 4\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM PT\nVenue: Brad Garrett’s Comedy Club\nAddress: 3799 Las Vegas Blvd South\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109 (inside MGM Grand)\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid photo ID\nParking: MGM Grand parking available \nAbout Sarah Colonna\nSarah Colonna is a stand-up comedian\, actress\, and New York Times bestselling author best known as a roundtable regular on E!’s Chelsea Lately. She has appeared on Awkward\, Anger Management\, and The Goldbergs\, and has released multiple stand-up specials. Her books Life As I Blow It and Has Anyone Seen My Pants? were both bestsellers. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHeadlining stand-up set by Sarah Colonna\nSpecial appearance by Brad Garrett\nIntimate showroom setting inside MGM Grand\nSharp\, candid\, and relatable comedy\n18+ show with adult humor\nBest available seating within purchased zone\n\nVenue Information\nBrad Garrett’s Comedy Club is located inside the MGM Grand Hotel & Casino on the Las Vegas Strip\, offering a premium comedy experience in an intimate setting with excellent sightlines and a lively atmosphere. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $83. Seating is best available within the zone purchased — seats are not assigned until arrival. There is an overall 8-ticket limit per order. All performers subject to change without notice. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/sarah-colonna-live-at-brad-garretts-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Brad Garrett’s Comedy Club\, 3799 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV\, 89109\, USA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/e462b191-f0c2-484c-8986-67ab8776ba07_1619491_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_LARGE_16_9-B3kVDC.jpg
GEO:36.1036218;-115.167586
