SUMMARY:Joe Wong LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club - Sacramento
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nJoe Wong LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nComedian Joe Wong brings his acclaimed stand-up to Punch Line Comedy Club in Sacramento on August 5\, 2026! Known for his deadpan delivery and brilliantly crafted jokes\, Joe Wong is one of the most distinctive voices in comedy today. \nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday\, August 5\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nAddress: 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid government-issued photo ID\nBeverage Minimum: 2 beverages per person \nAbout Joe Wong\nJoe Wong is a Chinese-American stand-up comedian who rose to national fame with his appearances on The Late Show with David Letterman and The Tonight Show. His unique blend of self-deprecating humor\, sharp wit\, and immigrant perspective has earned him a devoted following and critical acclaim across the comedy world. \nWhat to Expect\n\nDeadpan stand-up comedy with brilliant joke construction\nUnique immigrant perspective and self-deprecating humor\nIntimate club setting at Sacramento’s premier comedy venue\nFull bar service with 2-beverage minimum\nA memorable night of intelligent\, hilarious comedy\n\nVenue Information\nPunch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento is located at 2100 Arden Way in Sacramento\, CA. One of the top comedy clubs in Northern California\, it features a full bar\, great sightlines\, and ample free parking in the shopping center lot. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $32. This is an 18+ event with a 2-beverage minimum per person. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale). \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/joe-wong-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club-sacramento/
LOCATION:Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\, 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA\, 95825
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/a/eb7/edaff86b-e7ff-4f15-acce-73e835570eb7_RETINA_PORTRAIT_16_9.jpg
