SUMMARY:Rogelio Ramos LIVE at Chicago Improv
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets \nRogelio Ramos LIVE at Chicago Improv\nRogelio Ramos brings his hilarious Spanish-language stand-up comedy to the Chicago Improv in Schaumburg for a special En Español performance. One of Latin comedy’s biggest stars\, Ramos delivers high-energy\, relatable humor that resonates with audiences across generations. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, August 6\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors: 5:00 PM)\nVenue: Chicago Improv\nAddress: 5 Woodfield Mall K120B\, Schaumburg\, IL 60173\nAge Requirement: 21+ (Valid ID required)\nLanguage: En Español (Spanish-language performance)\nSeating: General Admission (first-come\, first-served)\nMinimum: 2-item food/drink minimum per person \nAbout Rogelio Ramos\nRogelio Ramos is one of the most popular Spanish-language stand-up comedians in the United States and Latin America. Known for his energetic performances and sharp cultural observations\, Ramos has built a massive following with his relatable humor about family\, relationships\, and everyday life. His shows consistently sell out across the country. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy Spanish-language stand-up comedy\nHilarious cultural observations and family humor\nIntimate comedy club atmosphere at Chicago Improv\nFull food and drink service (2-item minimum)\n21+ event — valid photo ID required\nDoors open at 5:00 PM — arrive early for best seats\n\nVenue Information\nChicago Improv is located inside Woodfield Mall in Schaumburg\, IL\, one of the premier comedy clubs in the Chicago area. The venue offers a full menu and bar service in an intimate showroom setting perfect for live comedy. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $65.73. Available through Ticketmaster. All sales are final. \nOfficial Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
