SUMMARY:Mark Normand LIVE at Cobb's Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nMark Normand is one of the hardest-working and most respected stand-up comedians in the game today. Known for his rapid-fire delivery\, self-deprecating humor\, and brilliantly crafted one-liners\, Normand has earned praise from comedy legends including Jerry Seinfeld\, who dubbed him “the best young up-and-coming comedian.” \nA New Orleans native based in New York\, Mark Normand has released multiple acclaimed comedy specials including Out to Lunch\, Don’t Be Yourself\, and Soup to Nuts. He’s a regular on late-night television\, a beloved podcast host\, and one of the most in-demand live performers on the comedy circuit today. \nHis shows are a masterclass in stand-up — tight\, clever\, and relentlessly funny from the first joke to the last. Catching Mark Normand live at an intimate venue like Cobb’s Comedy Club is a rare treat that comedy fans won’t want to miss. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, August 6\, 2026 (also Fri Aug 7 & Sat Aug 8)\nTime: 7:30 PM PDT (Thu) | 7:30 PM & 9:45 PM (Fri) | 7:00 PM & 9:15 PM (Sat)\nVenue: Cobb’s Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94133\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum\nTicket Price Range: $38 – $65 \nAbout the Venue\nCobb’s Comedy Club is San Francisco’s most celebrated stand-up destination\, located at 915 Columbus Avenue in the heart of the North Beach neighborhood. With a capacity of approximately 400 guests\, Cobb’s delivers an intimate\, up-close comedy experience that puts every audience member close to the action. \nThe club features a full bar and dining service\, with cocktails\, beer\, wine\, and food available throughout the show. The classic comedy club layout — tables and chairs arranged around a central stage — creates a lively\, communal atmosphere that makes every laugh feel bigger. \nCobb’s has hosted virtually every major name in comedy over its storied history and is widely regarded as one of the best comedy rooms in the country. Parking is available in nearby garages\, and the venue is easily accessible by BART and Muni. \nWhat to Expect\nMark Normand performs five shows across the weekend of August 6–8\, giving fans multiple opportunities to catch this comedy powerhouse live. Each show is a full stand-up set — fast\, funny\, and packed with the kind of sharp writing that has made Normand one of the most talked-about comedians of his generation. \nThe 18+ age restriction and 2-beverage minimum are in effect for all shows. Doors open approximately 30–45 minutes before showtime. Arrive early to secure a great seat and enjoy a pre-show drink before the laughs begin. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $38 – $65 (before taxes and fees)\nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/mark-normand-live-at-cobbs-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Cobb’s Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, California\, 94133\, United States Of America
