SUMMARY:Justin Martindale LIVE at Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets\n\nAbout the Performer\nJustin Martindale is an LA-based comedian\, writer\, producer\, and actor who was the last hand-picked paid regular at The World Famous Comedy Store by the legendary Mitzi Shore herself. That distinction alone speaks volumes about his talent and the respect he commands in the comedy world. \nJustin hosted the highly popular E! Entertainment bi-weekly digital series What the Fashion\, and can be heard on Radio Andy on Sirius XM. He is also the host of his own weekly charting podcast Just Sayin’ with Justin Martindale. When he’s not in high demand across multiple platforms\, Justin performs stand-up all over the country. \nHis comedy is sharp\, witty\, and delivered with the kind of confidence that only comes from years of performing at the highest levels of the industry. Justin’s shows are consistently entertaining and leave audiences wanting more. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, August 6\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:30 PM CDT\nDoors Open: 6:30 PM CDT\nVenue: Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\nAddress: 618 NW Loop 410\, San Antonio\, TX 78216\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event — Valid photo ID required\n\nAbout the Venue\nLaugh Out Loud Comedy Club is San Antonio’s premier stand-up comedy destination\, conveniently located in Park North Plaza at Loop 410 and Blanco — just inside the loop and only a few miles from the airport. \nThe club features a full bar lounge where guests can grab a drink before the show\, and a comfortable showroom with first-come\, first-served seating. Preferred Tables are located center stage for the best views\, while General Admission tables are positioned on the sides and wings. \nThere is a 2-item food or beverage minimum per person once seated\, and an 18% service charge applies to all checks in the showroom. Early arrival is strongly recommended to secure your preferred seating. \nWhat to Expect\nJustin Martindale brings the energy and polish of a Comedy Store veteran to the intimate setting of Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club. His comedy is sharp\, fast-paced\, and delivered with impeccable timing that comes from years of performing at the highest levels of the industry. \nThis is a solo headlining show — a rare opportunity to see one of LA’s most in-demand comedians in an intimate San Antonio club setting. Whether you’re a longtime fan or discovering Justin for the first time\, you’re in for a fantastic Thursday night of comedy. \nGrab your tickets now before they sell out! \nTicket Information\n\nGeneral Admission: $20 (+ fees)\nPreferred Seating: $30 (+ fees)\nOrder Limit: 10 tickets per order\n\n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/justin-martindale-live-at-laugh-out-loud-comedy-club/
