SUMMARY:Cipha Sounds LIVE at Punch Line Irving
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nCipha Sounds (born Luis Diaz) is a Bronx-born Puerto Rican-American comedian\, DJ\, and radio personality who has become one of New York City’s most beloved entertainment figures. Best known for his 17-year run at legendary hip-hop radio station Hot 97\, Cipha has seamlessly transitioned from the DJ booth to the comedy stage. \nAs the DJ for the iconic Dave Chappelle Show and a longtime fixture of NYC’s comedy scene\, Cipha Sounds brings a uniquely hip-hop-infused energy to stand-up comedy. His humor is sharp\, self-aware\, and deeply rooted in his experiences growing up in the Bronx\, navigating the worlds of hip-hop\, radio\, and entertainment. \nCipha co-hosts the popular Talk Clearlyer podcast and has performed stand-up comedy around the world. He has appeared on MTV\, BET\, and Comedy Central\, and is known for his ability to connect with audiences through storytelling\, crowd work\, and his infectious personality. Fans can expect a high-energy\, laugh-filled night that blends hip-hop culture with sharp comedic observations. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, August 6\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Irving\nAddress: 310 W Las Colinas Blvd.\, Suite 130\, Irving\, TX 75039\nAge Restriction: 18+ with valid government-issued photo ID required\nBeverage Minimum: 2-drink minimum per person\nAdditional Dates: Also performing Fri Aug 7 at 7:00 PM and Sat Aug 8 at 7:00 PM & 9:15 PM\n\nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Irving is one of the Dallas-Fort Worth area’s premier stand-up comedy clubs\, located in the heart of the Las Colinas urban center in Irving\, Texas. Part of the nationally recognized Punch Line Comedy Club brand\, this venue delivers an intimate\, club-style atmosphere that puts fans close to the action. \nThe club is situated inside the vibrant Toyota Music Factory entertainment complex at 310 W Las Colinas Blvd.\, Suite 130 — a destination packed with restaurants\, bars\, and entertainment options. The venue features a full bar\, table seating\, and a dedicated stage designed to maximize the comedy experience. With a capacity that keeps the room feeling personal and energetic\, every seat feels like a great seat. \nParking is available throughout the Toyota Music Factory complex\, with both surface lots and a parking garage nearby. The venue is easily accessible from major highways including I-635 and TX-114\, making it convenient for attendees coming from Dallas\, Fort Worth\, and surrounding suburbs. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo headlining stand-up comedy show featuring Cipha Sounds performing his latest material. Expect a high-energy evening packed with hip-hop references\, personal storytelling\, crowd interaction\, and sharp comedic observations drawn from his decades in the entertainment industry. \nThe show runs approximately 90 minutes and is recommended for mature audiences. The intimate club setting at Punch Line Irving creates the perfect environment for Cipha’s conversational\, crowd-engaging style. Come ready to laugh\, enjoy a drink\, and experience one of NYC’s most entertaining personalities live on stage in Irving\, Texas. \nNote: This is an 18+ event. Please bring a valid\, government-issued photo ID. A 2-beverage minimum per person applies. \nTicket Information\nTickets are priced from $32 – $75 depending on seating section. General Admission seating starts at $32. Preferred seating options are also available at higher price points. \nPurchase your official tickets directly through Ticketmaster\, or find resale tickets through VividSeats with their 100% Buyer Guarantee. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/cipha-sounds-live-at-punch-line-irving/
