SUMMARY:"Weird Al" Yankovic: Bigger & Weirder 2026 Tour LIVE at Ruoff Music Center
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\n“Weird Al” Yankovic: Bigger & Weirder 2026 Tour LIVE at Ruoff Music Center\nThe undisputed king of comedy music\, “Weird Al” Yankovic\, is bringing his brand-new  to Ruoff Music Center in Noblesville\, Indiana! Known for his hilarious parodies and original comedy songs\, Weird Al delivers a spectacular live show packed with costumes\, props\, and non-stop laughs. Don’t miss this legendary performer live on stage! \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, August 6\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM\nVenue: Ruoff Music Center\nAddress: 12880 E. 146th St.\, Noblesville\, IN 46060\nParking: Parking available on-site (sold separately)\nAge Requirement: All ages welcome \nAbout “Weird Al” Yankovic\n \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilarious parodies of today’s biggest pop hits\nElaborate costume changes and theatrical performances\nClassic fan-favorite songs spanning four decades\nOriginal comedy songs and polka medleys\nA high-energy\, family-friendly comedy concert experience\n\n\nVenue Information\nRuoff Music Center is one of Indiana’s premier outdoor amphitheaters\, located at 12880 E. 146th St. in Noblesville\, IN. The venue features both covered pavilion seating and open lawn areas\, offering a fantastic concert experience for all attendees. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $42. Secure your seats now before they sell out! Both official Ticketmaster tickets and resale options are available. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
