DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nNate Bargatze: Big Dumb Eyes World Tour LIVE at UBS Arena\nNate Bargatze brings his hilarious Big Dumb Eyes World Tour to UBS Arena in Belmont Park\, NY. Known for his unique comedic style and engaging storytelling\, Nate delivers an unforgettable night of stand-up comedy that will have audiences laughing throughout the show. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 7\, 2026 \nTime: 7:00 PM \nVenue: UBS Arena \nAddress: Belmont Park\, NY \nAge Requirement: All Ages \nAbout Nate Bargatze\nNate Bargatze is a talented stand-up comedian known for his distinctive comedic voice and engaging performances. His comedy draws from personal experiences and observations\, delivering laughs with authenticity and charm that resonates with audiences of all backgrounds. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy performance\nUnique comedic style and storytelling\nInteractive audience engagement\nAn unforgettable night of entertainment\nWorld-class venue experience at UBS Arena\nComedy that appeals to all audiences\n\nVenue Information\nUBS Arena is a state-of-the-art entertainment venue located in Belmont Park\, NY\, known for hosting world-class performers and productions. The venue offers excellent acoustics and a vibrant atmosphere perfect for live comedy performances. \nTicket Information\nTickets are available starting at $50+. Secure your tickets now for this special performance. Limited availability expected. \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
