SUMMARY:Ron Funches LIVE at Punch Line Houston
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Ron Funches\nRon Funches is the human embodiment of a warm hug that somehow learned to roast you — with love. A master of joyful\, disarming stand-up\, Ron has released multiple acclaimed comedy specials and is a fan-favorite on TV series including Peacock’s The Traitors\, Apple TV’s Loot\, and FOX’s New Girl. His voice acting career is equally impressive — you’ve heard him in Pixar’s Inside Out 2\, the DreamWorks Trolls franchise\, and Harley Quinn. \nWith numerous late-night appearances\, writing credits\, and a reputation as one of the warmest performers in comedy\, Ron Funches turns warmth\, weirdness\, and razor-sharp jokes into pure delight. His live shows are consistently praised for their positive energy\, genuine connection with the audience\, and non-stop laughs from start to finish. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 7\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:00 PM (Late show at 9:15 PM also available)\nVenue: Punch Line Houston\nAddress: 1204 Caroline Street\, Houston\, TX 77002\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum\nTicket Price: From $38 \nAbout Punch Line Houston\nPunch Line Houston is downtown Houston’s premier stand-up comedy club\, located at 1204 Caroline Street. Part of the nationally recognized Punch Line Comedy Club brand\, this intimate venue delivers an up-close comedy experience that puts you right in the action. \nThe club features table seating\, a full-service bar\, and a two-drink minimum. The warm\, intimate atmosphere is a perfect match for Ron’s signature style of joyful\, crowd-connecting comedy. Parking is available in nearby downtown Houston garages. \nWhat to Expect\nRon Funches’ live show is a masterclass in feel-good comedy. He has a rare ability to make an entire room feel like they’re in on the joke together — his warmth is infectious\, his timing is impeccable\, and his punchlines consistently land harder than you expect. Fans of his TV work will find his stand-up even more personal and hilarious. \nRon is performing a full weekend run at Punch Line Houston — Friday August 7 at 7:00 PM and 9:15 PM\, and Saturday August 8 at 7:00 PM and 9:15 PM. This is an 18+ event with a two-beverage minimum per guest. \nTicket Information\nPrice: From $38\nTickets available via Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/ron-funches-live-at-punch-line-houston/
LOCATION:Punch Line Houston\, 1204 Caroline Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
